      "AscendantEquipment": {
        "Set0": "Borrowed Dew: primary attacks earn at most 1 bud per second, up to 3\nPress the divine armor skill key (default K) to spend all buds, releasing a seeking blade with 32 base generic damage per bud\nGain 15% movement speed for 4 seconds; 12-second cooldown; blades cannot build buds\nUnequipping and death remove benefits without resetting cooldown",
        "Set1": "Burning Law: primary hits build at most 5 heat per 0.1 seconds, up to 100; injuries remove 25 heat\nAt full heat, press the divine armor skill key (default K) for 10 seconds of 22% helmet-class damage and 12% movement speed\nThe first enemy hit during this window loses 25% damage, capped at 60\nRecovery: 25 seconds after the effect ends (35 seconds from activation); unequipping and death cannot reset it",
        "Set2": "Rewrite This Moment: press the divine armor skill key (default K) to mark your position; press again within 6 seconds to return\nMaximum range 100 tiles; no solid destinations, life/mana/skill rollback, or extra immunity\nReturning grants 15% helmet-class damage for 6 seconds; cooldown 30 seconds from marking\nUnequipping, death and world changes cancel the mark without resetting cooldown",
        "DewReady": "Three buds: skill ready",
        "HeatReady": "Full heat: Burning Law ready",
        "ReturnReady": "Press skill again to return"
      }
